    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;,Tahoma,Simsun;font-size:15px\">有没有方法LIST中不是指定某几只股票，而是交易所中的所有股票？</span><br style=\"word-wrap:break-word;padding:0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;,Tahoma,Simsun;font-size:15px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&quot;Microsoft Yahei&quot;,Tahoma,Simsun;font-size:15px\">最后我想是输出一个符合条件（WT1 &gt; WT2 &amp; WT1&lt;＝-53）的清单／列表，请问应该怎样修改？</span><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Microsoft Yahei, Tahoma, Simsun\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Microsoft Yahei, Tahoma, Simsun\"><div><span style=\"font-size:15px\">library(quantmod)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:15px\">stocks &lt;- c(&quot;AAPL&quot;, &quot;GOOG&quot;, &quot;FB&quot;)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:15px\">stockEnv &lt;- new.env()</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:15px\">symbols &lt;- getSymbols(stocks, src=&#39;yahoo&#39;, env=stockEnv)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:15px\">for (stock in ls(stockEnv)){</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:15px\">        getSymbols(stock)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:15px\">        chartSeries(stockEnv[[stock]], theme=&quot;white&quot;, name=stock,subset=&#39;last 30 days&#39;)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:15px\">        WT1 &lt;- EMA(((stockEnv[[stock]][,2]+stockEnv[[stock]][,3]+stockEnv[[stock]][,4])/3 - EMA((stockEnv[[stock]][,2]+stockEnv[[stock]][,3]+stockEnv[[stock]][,4])/3,N=10)) / (0.015 * EMA(abs((stockEnv[[stock]][,2]+stockEnv[[stock]][,3]+stockEnv[[stock]][,4])/3 - EMA((stockEnv[[stock]][,2]+stockEnv[[stock]][,3]+stockEnv[[stock]][,4])/3,N=10)), N=10)), N=21)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:15px\">        WT2 &lt;- SMA(WT1,n=4)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:15px\">}</span></div></font><br><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">18xn...@gmail.com</a>於 2017年9月20日星期三 UTC+8下午6時03分32秒寫道：</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><font color=\"#2bbde2\">請問這樣的R選股代碼應如何寫？</font></p><p><span><br></span></p><p><span>N1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">:=10;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">N2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">:=21;</span></p><p><span><br></span></p><p><span>AP</span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">:=(</span><span>HIGH</span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">+</span><span>CLOSE</span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">+</span><span>LOW</span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">)/</span><span>3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34)\">;</span><br></p>\r\n<p><span>ESA</span>:=<span>EMA</span>(<span>AP</span>,<span>N1</span>); //取AP值的N1天的EMA數據，以下如此類推</p>\r\n<p><span>D</span> := <span>EMA</span>(<span>ABS</span>(<span>AP</span> - <span>ESA</span>), <span>N1</span>);</p>\r\n<p><span>CI</span> := (<span>AP</span> - <span>ESA</span>) / (<span>0</span>.<span>015</span> * <span>D</span>);</p>\r\n<p><span>TCI</span> := <span>EMA</span>(<span>CI</span>, <span>N2</span>);</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p><span>WT1</span><span>:</span><span>TCI</span><span>;</span></p>\r\n<p><span>WT2</span><span>:</span><span>MA</span><span>(</span><span>WT1</span><span>,</span><span>4</span><span>)</span><span>;</span></p><p><span><br></span></p><p><span>選股條件為WT1&gt;WT2（出現金叉）AND WT1&lt;-53。</span></p><p><span><br></span></p><p><span><br></span></p></div></blockquote></div></div>"
